# Ignore every package, then allowlist our own. The inversion is load-bearing:
# the VPM resolver drops the (non-redistributable) VRChat SDK and its friends
# in here, and this file makes committing them structurally impossible.
# The bootstrapper is the one VRChat package that ships with the repo; the
# resolver it downloads (com.vrchat.core.vpm-resolver) stays local.
/*/
!com.vrchat.core.bootstrap

# Keep this in sync with your package directories under Packages/
!net.wirenook.package-template
